### MSI and Covered Code MSI formulas

Source: https://github.com/infection/infection/blob/master/src/Metrics/Calculator.php

MSI = `(killed + errors + timed_out) / total_mutants * 100`. Covered Code MSI excludes `not_covered` mutants from the denominator, scoring only mutants reachable by tests. The `timeoutsAsEscaped` flag determines whether timed-out mutants count toward killed (default) or are excluded — showing that timeout interpretation is configurable. MSI guarantees a minimum percentage of detected syntactic changes but says nothing about uncovered code (that is Covered Code MSI's role) nor about correctness.

```php
public function getMutationScoreIndicator(): float
{
    if ($this->mutationScoreIndicator !== null) {
        return $this->mutationScoreIndicator;
    }

    $score = 0.;
    $coveredTotal = $this->killedCount + $this->errorCount;

    if (!$this->timeoutsAsEscaped) {
        $coveredTotal += $this->timedOutCount;
    }

    $totalCount = $this->totalCount;

    if ($totalCount !== 0) {
        $score = 100 * $coveredTotal / $totalCount;
    }

    return $this->mutationScoreIndicator = $this->round($score);
}

public function getCoveredCodeMutationScoreIndicator(): float
{
    if ($this->coveredMutationScoreIndicator !== null) {
        return $this->coveredMutationScoreIndicator;
    }

    $score = 0.;
    $testedTotal = $this->totalCount - $this->notTestedCount;
    $coveredTotal = $this->killedCount + $this->errorCount;

    if (!$this->timeoutsAsEscaped) {
        $coveredTotal += $this->timedOutCount;
    }

    if ($testedTotal !== 0) {
        $score = 100 * $coveredTotal / $testedTotal;
    }

    return $this->coveredMutationScoreIndicator = $this->round($score);
}
```

--------------------------------

### Mutate only covered source files

Source: https://github.com/infection/infection/blob/master/src/Mutation/FileMutationGenerator.php

When `onlyCovered` is true and a source file has no covering tests at all, the generator yields zero mutations for that file — skipping it entirely. This is how Infection restricts mutation to only covered source files. Combined with `--git-diff-base` (changed files only), selective mutation is achieved.

```php
